e of the dragon  it would not have taken him that long to  write just one episode but i do  understand him not wanting to get  distracted while he is finishing the  winds of winter  he basically said he would not let  anything get in his way of finishing  this book  but has he stuck by this ever since he  gave us that update  well i don't think so aren't you  supposed to be finishing the winds of  winter this entire time  not to add to the chorus of what is  taking so long but this is a 700 page  detour as a matter of fact he has been  writing something that has absolutely  nothing to do with the song of ice and  fire  let alone the winds of winter now i  don't know how many of you saw this but  let me show you an article that was  released yesterday  the headline states george r martin's  next project is confirmed to be released  before the winds of winter  that's right ladies and gentlemen george  rr martin has actually been working on a  video game  as well as all the other things he has  been working on instead of the winds of  winter  this article says he has been writing  the overarching mythos on eldon ring  the first video game he has ever written  for it sounds like george has been  writing the story  themes and maybe even the dialogue now  speaking further about george rr  martin's involvement in the video game  one of the executives at the company  said he told george about his vision for  the game  and that allowed them to have many free  and creative conversations regarding the  game  in which mr martin later used that as a  base to write the overarching mythos for  the world itself  he also went on to say the mythos george  created for the game was full of  interesting characters and drama  along with a plethora of mystical and  mysterious elements as well  that is certainly one thing george rr  martin is very good at  now like i said at the beginning of this  video i want to know what all of you  think about george working on things  other than the wi