s we will  have to wait even longer for the ending  of a song of ice and fire  that is if we will ever see it at all i  have always been very optimistic when it  comes to the ones of winner getting  released soon  but it gets harder and harder to look at  that glass half full  when the years keep flying by let me  know what your thoughts are on all of  this  do you think the winds of winter is  still his main focus  do you think we will get it soon and how  do you feel when his other works are  getting released before the book  leave your thoughts down below as always  thank all of you for watching the video  i hope you have a great day i will see  you again very soon  [Music]  bye  [Music]  so  you

